      "writtenOn": "2020-10-02T09:49:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, the inconsistency is unfortunate, and maybe returning the account is the better behavior, but arguably the 8555 behavior is the only one that\u0027s documented, so I am not convinced we should change documented behavior to match undocumented ones. (For sure we should not remove the error and break code.)",
      "revId": "dc362540ddfd132d9b1b8aa30d31f2a5e0fcd496",
